## Project Context

### Project Name
Roofiant — a Laravel REST API backend

### Tech Stack
- Laravel 12 (modular structure)
- PHP 8.3
- PostgreSQL (via pgsql driver)
- Laravel Sanctum (API token auth)
- No frontend — pure JSON API

